{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7e62508a869be8ec4599a8c12ac82e30a1594fa841746b5d9dba3f91fce2de8b","ja":"えっ！　あ、ホントだ！\n赤くなってきてる！","zh":"诶！啊，真的耶！\n渐渐变红了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b13f5c860a196500d1c24524fc60d138f421dcab0ea62f03daadc628af93293b","ja":"うふふっ。\nあともう少しですね～♪","zh":"呵呵。\n还差一点点了呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7a8ebdfe94805f408007dc351b75242fbe191f03f4a9f71e8257fbc4e6af2fb9","ja":"事の起こりは昨年末のこと……","zh":"事情要从去年年底说起……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7de8c7208cbba0243fe0d161be371b44ff7c75f1f19022fe1e6e1e62c8f4762d","ja":"初日の出をバックに、私たちで写真撮影ですか～。\n『アイドルと一緒に年越し』がテーマなんですね～。","zh":"以新年初日为背景，由我们来拍照啊～。\n主题是“和偶像一起跨年”呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dc5f0e428c4f92939e132eb3b5ff5ffdd6a23023110cb245242879753a22fb39","ja":"いいと思いますよ～。子豚ちゃんたちも、\n新年の聖母の姿を待ち望んでいることでしょうから～。","zh":"我觉得挺好的哦～。毕竟小猪崽们\n肯定也一直在殷切期盼着新年圣母的英姿呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3cf4dd7d961bd1ae61bd6037f8f2b662772f54eb0911767e38c4ee5213716a61","ja":"ええ～！　お正月から働かなきゃいけないんだよ！？\n兄ちゃんの鬼！　悪魔！　すっとこどっこい！","zh":"诶～！大过年的居然还得工作吗！？\n哥哥你这个魔鬼！恶魔！大笨蛋！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"02dc59747c441e3d0c21971e460a357abbb5248b28b289fcfe80cd3aef5aaa9f","ja":"あははっ。でも初日の出って縁起ええし、\n新年早々みんなで集まるのも、きっと楽しいで？","zh":"啊哈哈。不过看新年的日出很吉利，\n而且新年伊始大家聚在一起，肯定也会很开心的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"386be5166a145f572cd0c695f433e56acb8417726122fd61845f70d87e04e268","ja":"撮影場所は、私らで決められるんやんな？\nどこがええやろ？","zh":"拍摄地点是由我们来定对吧？\n选哪里好呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1137.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a3102accf3cbd531c28f3e6068f0d19f4db5f46a12fffb7e641ab93cf3a4ea58","ja":"うーん、亜美のテンションが\n爆上がりになる場所がいいな～。例えば……。","zh":"嗯——要是能去个让亚美情绪\n暴涨的地方就好了～比如……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
